# Admin Dashboard Rules

Admin dashboard modules:
- Overview
- Leads
- Students
- Applications
- Documents
- Counselors
- Universities
- Courses
- Scholarships
- Blog posts
- Testimonials
- FAQs
- Settings

Lead statuses:
- new
- contacted
- qualified
- not_qualified
- converted_to_student
- lost

Application statuses:
- profile_review
- documents_pending
- university_shortlisting
- application_submitted
- offer_received
- tuition_payment
- visa_documents
- visa_submitted
- visa_approved
- pre_departure
- completed
- rejected

Admin features:
- View statistics
- Filter leads
- Assign counselor
- Add notes
- Convert lead to student
- Manage applications
- Review documents
- Manage content
- Export data where needed

Rules:
- Use tables for data-heavy pages.
- Add filters and search early.
- Keep actions explicit.
- Confirm destructive actions.
- Show empty states.
- Show loading states.
- Do not expose service role logic in components.
